  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Conjuration sphere (Web Spinner (form)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your companion may use its web ability a number of times per minute equal to its Constitution modifier. Additionally, as a full-round action, your companion may render a creature that is entangled by its web and within its reach helpless. Such a creature counts as being tied up, increasing the DC to escape to 20 + 1/2 of the companion’s Hit Dice + Constitution modifier. The helpless creature may still attempt Strength and Escape Artist checks to free themselves as normal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/companion-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
